cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the article below."
title: "Bunkbot: reproduction package for \"AI can effectively promote conspiracies unless it is truth constrained\""
abstract: >-
  Self-contained reproduction repository for four experiments, three pre-registered
  (Studies 1-4, N = 3,996), testing whether large language models can both instil
  ("bunk") and dispel ("debunk") conspiracy beliefs. Every reported number, table,
  and figure is reproduced API-free from de-identified data and cached model
  annotations through one shared recompute (ALL_NUMBERS), rendered via
  results_methods.Rmd and the Supplementary Information.
